        },
        {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/capabilityPromptSystemMessage"
        },
        {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/capabilityReasoningToggle"
        },
        {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/capabilityReasoningEffort"
        },
        {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/capabilityVisionImage"
        },
        {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/capabilityDocumentRead"
        },
        {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/capabilityToolWebSearch"
        },
        {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/capabilityToolReadUrl"
        }
      ],
      "description": "一项能力声明;按 id 与同一 id 下的 style 或 mode 判别,各分支字段封闭。新增能力须在此增加分支、补 $defs 并更新 docs/spec.md。能力标识一律 namespace:verb 冒号形态。"
    }
  }
